WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.875
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers...

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:06.166
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.166 --> 00:00:07.666
Players stop being polite...

00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.583
This is...

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:11.458
The Champions.

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:13.291
And for my next trick,

00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:16.416
I will make myself reappear as a relevant player!

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.291
Now that the transfer window is over,

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:20.125
I could spend more time pursuing my hobbies.

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:21.583
Ya know, like playing football!

00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:23.500
Hi, this is me, Christian Eriksen! 

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.083
I love to play football for Tottenham Hotspur, I'm so happy!

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:29.041
Ah, no. Hello.

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:30.416
Watch out Champions League, 

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:32.708
it's time for Atlanta to rock your world.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:34.416
Uh, it's Atalanta.

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:35.250
Ah, s--t. 

00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:09.833
So, today is arrival day,

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:14.250
and I'm really excited to be in the Champions League mansion

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:18.833
with a club that actually has a chance to make it out of the group stage.

00:01:20.791 --> 00:01:21.583
Jow!

00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:23.375
Oh, sorry, I didn't see you...

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:24.416
you must have been in my shadow. 

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:26.750
Uh...what are you talking about?

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.541
Joao, listen, I know that you feel a lot of pressure;

00:01:30.541 --> 00:01:35.000
because to be compared to me, this must be very hard.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.666
I don't...I really haven't thought about it.

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:40.291
Shhhh, baby, baby, shhh, it's OK, it's OK. 

00:01:40.291 --> 00:01:43.416
You just be the best Joao Felix that you can be...

00:01:43.416 --> 00:01:47.041
because there will never be anyone who can match my skills

00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:48.166
or my amount of troph-

00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:51.416
-my good looks.

00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:53.333
Here...I want you to take this.

00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:56.416
It is trophy from something I don't remember.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:02:00.541
Whoa, the Nations League cup. Aw, man. I don't deserve this.

00:02:00.541 --> 00:02:02.166
I think it should go to our best player.

00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:05.750
Ah, thank you, but, you know, I already have too many trophies.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.083
Oh, no, I meant Bernardo.

00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:14.833
And here is the kitchen.

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:15.583
Whoa.

00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:18.916
So, I decided to take Luka Jovic under my wing.

00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:24.333
I even let him into my elite society: ‘LUKAS OF REAL MADRID.'

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:29.750
OK, so, this is the Pirlo wine dispenser if you want wine.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:34.791
This is, uh, Maradona flour dispenser if you like to bake or something.

00:02:34.791 --> 00:02:36.250
What does this one do?

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.958
Oh, that's the Ballon d'Or.

00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:41.708
It’s supposed to make people care about you, but it does not seem to work.

00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:47.083
Here we are, lads! 

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:49.541
Looks like we’re taking over the Man United room.

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:52.083
I think I found Fellaini’s old hair.

00:02:52.083 --> 00:02:53.833
I think I found Alexis Sanchez.

00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:58.083
Guten tag!

00:02:58.083 --> 00:03:01.083
Any of you Englanders want some schweinekrusten? 

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:02.875
Germany definitely changed me. 

00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:04.750
But now, I’m in the Premier League,

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.166
So, I'm trying to make an effort to understand British culture, innit?

00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:11.041
So what the heck is up with this Brexit thing?

00:03:11.041 --> 00:03:13.750
Christian. Stop talking.

00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:15.833
Listen, Gabriel, I swear-

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:20.208
I’m going to find a way to get you more involved. You are just too talented-

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:25.375
Ah, Jurgen, my worthy German rival.

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:28.625
Pep, my classy Catalan competitor.

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:32.416
Champions League trophy...very nice.

00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:37.208
Premier League trophy...very nice.

00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:41.458
My doctor says whenever I get a trophy craving

00:03:41.458 --> 00:03:44.041
I should just put in a commemorative DVD

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:48.916
to remind me that it’s really about the journey, not the destination so much.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.125
It was a good run at Ajax,

00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.625
but I’m very excited to join Juventus because,

00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:58.333
well, mainly they’re paying me a lot of money. 

00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:05.000
Hey, Giorgio! My brother! So excited to be on the squad. What’s up?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.375
New transfers. Over there.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.458
I like it. I see so much new blood. 

00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:21.666
My children, are you willing to serve to sacrifice for the Old Lady?

00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:27.166
Very good. For she needs the fresh, new blood

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:33.250
to stay strong...to stay young. To be...

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.541
JUVENTUS.

00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:41.416
Wait...aren’t vampires supposed to like...not be in the sun?

00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:44.041
Vampire? Oh, I’m not a vampire.

00:04:44.041 --> 00:04:46.791
No, he just drains the life from everyone who plays with him.

